<metadata><name>Galičica trail T-2</name><desc>T-2 is one of Galičica National Park's harder and longer hiking trails, with more climbing. It's 3.5 km from Ramne to the H-4 junction, with about 456 m of climbing and 5 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 966 m and 1,426 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/t-2/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
